s it and bulldozing everything in its path!\n\nUse your racket's tractor beam to pull it back, or simply to line up your next shot exactly where you want it. \n\nBe quick and plan your shots well. Learn to control the ball to perfection.", "short_description": "Racket: Nx is new kind of game that challenges the limits of what you can do with a racket and ball in VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://racketnx-config.s3-us-west-1.amazonaws.com/racket-nx-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://onehamsa.com/", "publisher_name": "One Hamsa", "support_website_url": "https://racketnx.com/", "website_url": "https://racketnx.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "SOCIAL", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN", "ja", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "650303413056407"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "182021790376553"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "182021790376553"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1621609980, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "182021790376553"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4025536927525945", "version": "2.2.10"}, "id": "1867794283389806", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_o